@startuml CU-22
skinparam MaxMessageSize 150

title Diagrama de Secuencia de Diseño - CU-22 Consultar Productividad

actor "Director /\nResponsable" as U
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as FE
participant "API\n(FastAPI)" as API
participant "ProductivityService" as SVC
participant "ProductivityRepository" as REPO
database "PostgreSQL\n(Odoo)" as DB

U -> FE : Selecciona "Productividad"\ndesde catálogo de métricas (CU-10)
activate FE

U -> FE : Configura filtros opcionales:\nemployee_id, project_id,\ndate_from, date_to
FE -> API : GET /metrics/productivity\n?employee_id&project_id\n&date_from&date_to&root_only\n(JWT Bearer)
activate API

API -> API : require_manager_or_above(cu)\n→ 403 si rol = empleado

== Validaciones ==

opt date_from o date_to proporcionados
API -> API : validate_date_range(\ndate_from, date_to)
note right of API : 400 si rango inválido
end

opt employee_id proporcionado
API -> API : verify_employee_exists(db,\nemployee_id) → 404 si no existe
API -> API : verify_employee_scope(cu,\nemployee_id) → 403 si fuera de alcance
end

opt project_id proporcionado
API -> API : verify_project_exists(db,\nproject_id) → 404 si no existe
API -> API : verify_project_scope(cu,\nproject_id) → 403 si fuera de alcance
end

== Cálculo de productividad ==

API -> SVC : calculate(employee_id, project_id,\ndate_from, date_to, root_only)
activate SVC

SVC -> REPO : get_completed_tasks_with_hours(\ndb, employee_id, project_id,\ndate_from, date_to, root_only)
activate REPO

REPO -> DB : Subquery horas:\nSELECT task_id,\n SUM(unit_amount) AS actual_hours\nFROM account_analytic_line\n[WHERE employee_id = :eid]\n[WHERE date BETWEEN :from AND :to]\nGROUP BY task_id
activate DB
DB --> REPO : subquery horas
deactivate DB

REPO -> DB : Subquery etapas cerradas:\nSELECT id\nFROM project_task_type\nWHERE closed = True
activate DB
DB --> REPO : closed_stage_ids
deactivate DB

REPO -> DB : SELECT pt.id, pt.name,\n pt.planned_hours, pt.parent_id,\n COALESCE(sq.actual_hours, 0)\nFROM project_task pt\nLEFT OUTER JOIN subquery sq\n ON pt.id = sq.task_id\nWHERE pt.active = True\n AND pt.is_closed = True\n AND pt.stage_id IN (closed_ids)\n AND pt.planned_hours > 0\n [AND pt.project_id = :pid]\n [AND pt.parent_id IS NULL if root_only]
activate DB
DB --> REPO : filas de tareas con horas
deactivate DB

REPO --> SVC : task rows
deactivate REPO

SVC -> SVC : Para cada tarea con actual_hours > 0:\npct = (planned / actual) × 100\nCrea ProductivityTaskItem

SVC -> SVC : Ordena por pct DESC\nCalcula average_productivity

SVC --> API : ProductivityResponse {\n  average_productivity,\n  total_tasks,\n  tasks: [items]\n}
deactivate SVC

API --> FE : 200 OK (ProductivityResponse)
deactivate API

FE -> FE : Renderiza MetricCard preview\n(gauge + %) y MetricDetail\n(StatBox + BarChart top 8)

FE --> U : Muestra vista de productividad
deactivate FE

== Opcional: Guardar snapshot (extiende CU-17) ==

opt El usuario pulsa "Guardar Snapshot"

U -> FE : Click "Guardar Snapshot"
activate FE
FE -> FE : Empaqueta datos calculados
note right of FE : Se extiende CU-17\n(Guardar Snapshot)
FE --> U : Confirmación de guardado
deactivate FE

end

@enduml